.claude/
*.code-workspace

# OS noise
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal working documents.
#
# These are how the site got built, not part of the site. They carry sprint
# plans, scope cuts, unresolved TODOs and design mockups that are stale on the
# film's own title — none of which should be the first thing a visitor to the
# repository reads, and some of which would be actively misleading.
#
# They stay on disk and keep working locally; they are just no longer part of
# what the repository publishes.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/CLAUDE.md

# Everything under docs/ EXCEPT the database schema. `docs/*` rather than
# `docs/` on purpose: git will not descend into an excluded directory, so a
# negation inside one never matches. The schema is the one file here that is
# operational rather than editorial — it is what recreates the reviews table,
# its RLS policies and the rate-limit trigger from nothing.
docs/*
!docs/SUPABASE_SCHEMA.sql
